WEBVTT

00:01:33.070 --> 00:01:33.990
Teppei!

00:01:34.900 --> 00:01:37.780
The Earth Engine Impactor...

00:03:22.180 --> 00:03:23.390
Delicious.

00:03:26.350 --> 00:03:29.270
The Kill-T-Gang has broken through Defense Zone 1.

00:03:29.270 --> 00:03:31.060
Contact with the Earth Engine is imminent!

00:03:34.310 --> 00:03:36.610
I've found some new treats...

00:03:47.290 --> 00:03:49.250
Do you read me, Earth Driver?

00:03:49.250 --> 00:03:50.370
U-Uncle?

00:03:50.370 --> 00:03:51.250
Daichi?!

00:03:52.870 --> 00:03:53.880
Daichi?

00:03:54.960 --> 00:03:56.920
What are you doing out there?

00:03:57.500 --> 00:03:58.550
What <i>am</i> I doing?

00:04:01.630 --> 00:04:04.510
The consultation system is not yet operational!

00:04:04.840 --> 00:04:06.970
We're unable to assist the Earth Engine!

00:04:06.970 --> 00:04:08.390
What's wrong, Daichi?

00:04:08.390 --> 00:04:09.220
Answer me!

00:04:09.220 --> 00:04:09.720
Daichi!

00:04:10.140 --> 00:04:12.350
This is Peter Westvillage.

00:04:12.350 --> 00:04:14.230
Code Papillon, can you hear me?

00:04:15.440 --> 00:04:17.270
This is Code Papillon.

00:04:17.270 --> 00:04:18.690
I'm aware of the situation.

00:04:19.150 --> 00:04:20.190
Who is that?

00:04:20.190 --> 00:04:21.150
No idea.

00:04:21.150 --> 00:04:22.650
Impressive.

00:04:23.320 --> 00:04:26.370
Then I'm requesting navigational assistance for the Earth Engine.

00:04:26.700 --> 00:04:27.780
Roger that.

00:04:27.780 --> 00:04:29.950
I'll be borrowing your communication line!

00:04:31.750 --> 00:04:34.000
Earth Driver—you can hear me, right?

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:34.540
Who's there?

00:04:34.540 --> 00:04:35.830
Doesn't matter.

00:04:35.830 --> 00:04:37.630
I'm just a magical girl here to help you out.

00:04:38.210 --> 00:04:41.670
You are on a battlefield right now.
Do you understand that?

00:04:41.670 --> 00:04:43.840
I don't know if I understand or not.

00:04:46.970 --> 00:04:47.510
But...

00:04:48.600 --> 00:04:52.560
I do know that if this thing in front of me reaches Earth, it's going to be bad!

00:04:52.560 --> 00:04:53.520
Good enough.

00:04:54.190 --> 00:04:57.770
The Earth Engine is currently filled with the power of Livlaster...

00:04:57.770 --> 00:05:00.530
Which is just a fancy word for your life energy.

00:05:01.150 --> 00:05:03.240
You've figured out how to pilot it, haven't you?

00:05:03.820 --> 00:05:04.490
I have no idea.

00:05:04.820 --> 00:05:09.240
Whoa, hold on a second...
Then how the heck did you get up there?

00:05:09.240 --> 00:05:10.910
Was the gun controlling you?

00:05:10.910 --> 00:05:12.120
That's not it!

00:05:13.200 --> 00:05:16.790
My gut just tells me that I have to defeat that thing.

00:05:16.790 --> 00:05:19.040
That gun only gave me the power to do it.

00:05:19.460 --> 00:05:21.000
Then who are you?

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:22.380
Just a high school kid.

00:05:22.380 --> 00:05:23.300
Oh, come on...

00:05:23.880 --> 00:05:26.970
Fine, I'll take control.

00:05:26.970 --> 00:05:28.890
You can provide the power.

00:05:28.890 --> 00:05:31.260
Grip the Livlaster tightly.

00:05:35.850 --> 00:05:38.600
You stopped moving all of a sudden.

00:05:38.600 --> 00:05:40.570
Have I scared you?

00:05:52.540 --> 00:05:54.540
You're too slow!

00:06:05.010 --> 00:06:06.130
I can't hit her...

00:06:06.590 --> 00:06:10.800
This is pretty difficult to do without direct control.

00:06:11.640 --> 00:06:12.970
If you die, I'm sorry.

00:06:16.730 --> 00:06:18.770
Hey! Are you okay?!

00:06:20.860 --> 00:06:23.900
Die? Me?

00:06:25.110 --> 00:06:28.150
If your dad ever dies...

00:06:29.320 --> 00:06:31.490
He's going to do it with a smile on his face.

00:06:33.530 --> 00:06:35.120
I don't want...

00:06:35.120 --> 00:06:36.330
to die.

00:06:38.960 --> 00:06:40.170
I just need to hit it, right?

00:06:40.170 --> 00:06:42.460
Hey, what are you doing?

00:06:50.010 --> 00:06:50.590
That light...

00:06:51.640 --> 00:06:53.260
Orgone energy?

00:06:58.390 --> 00:07:00.100
Hey, wait! Hey!

00:07:05.400 --> 00:07:06.400
Impossible!

00:07:06.400 --> 00:07:07.110
I hit her!

00:07:07.110 --> 00:07:08.320
That's not the issue!

00:07:28.090 --> 00:07:29.550
I hit her...

00:07:29.550 --> 00:07:32.720
You... Might not be too bad. Interesting!

00:07:37.260 --> 00:07:40.230
Kill-T-Gang interception successful.

00:07:40.230 --> 00:07:41.730
What an ugly fight.

00:07:43.150 --> 00:07:44.690
But we won.

00:07:46.820 --> 00:07:47.900
That's right.

00:07:50.950 --> 00:07:53.360
Code Papillon, thank you for your help.

00:07:53.740 --> 00:07:56.410
It was the Earth Driver that did all the work.

00:07:56.410 --> 00:07:58.700
It was fun, Mr. Globe.

00:08:00.620 --> 00:08:02.620
I know I acted without consulting you,

00:08:02.620 --> 00:08:06.290
but given the urgency of the situation, I hope you'll forgive me.

00:08:06.290 --> 00:08:10.460
In my experience, she is the only flight director capable

00:08:10.970 --> 00:08:14.590
of assisting the Earth Engine in a situation like this.

00:08:14.590 --> 00:08:15.970
Who is she?

00:08:15.970 --> 00:08:19.520
Someone I was considering bringing to the base soon.

00:08:19.890 --> 00:08:22.180
I'll have her file sent to you later.

00:08:24.730 --> 00:08:28.360
This was clearly different from the one we saw nine years ago.

00:08:29.440 --> 00:08:33.490
As we feared, it seems the active phase of the Kill-T-Gang has begun.

00:08:33.490 --> 00:08:37.910
Raise all satellite bases to DEFCON 1,

00:08:37.910 --> 00:08:41.910
and have all Impactors in exterior defensive zones ready at a moment's notice.

00:08:43.330 --> 00:08:45.080
That aside...

00:08:45.880 --> 00:08:52.380
I hadn't heard about about an Earth Driver already being stationed at Tanegashima.

00:08:53.090 --> 00:08:54.590
Who could it be?

00:08:57.850 --> 00:09:01.220
Earth Engine has activated the feathering system.

00:09:01.220 --> 00:09:05.020
Autopilot has plotted a return course to Tanegashima.

00:09:05.690 --> 00:09:07.440
This is Salty Dog.

00:09:07.440 --> 00:09:09.570
The area around the airport has been cordoned off.

00:09:09.570 --> 00:09:11.110
Commence operation immediately.

00:09:11.610 --> 00:09:14.820
This is Tanegashima HQ—roger that.

00:09:37.090 --> 00:09:39.300
So you're the Earth Driver, huh?

00:09:45.640 --> 00:09:49.150
The Name of the Gun
Is Livlaster

00:09:56.610 --> 00:09:58.860
I haven't detected any physical abnormalities.

00:09:59.450 --> 00:10:01.530
Or at least, I haven't yet.

00:10:22.260 --> 00:10:25.140
It seems a second Livlaster has appeared.

00:10:25.810 --> 00:10:30.860
You said nothing to us of this possibility.

00:10:31.650 --> 00:10:34.730
You said nothing to me...

00:10:35.780 --> 00:10:37.070
Well, it doesn't matter.

00:10:37.070 --> 00:10:40.030
We should have plenty of time to discuss it now.

00:10:40.570 --> 00:10:41.910
Looks like your fever's down.

00:10:42.530 --> 00:10:45.120
I'll need to speak with you, as well.

00:10:45.580 --> 00:10:50.370
About that rainbow you were probably responsible for.

00:10:51.420 --> 00:10:55.880
On the outside, Globe is an international organization

00:10:55.880 --> 00:10:59.260
devoted to peaceful space development...

00:11:00.470 --> 00:11:04.760
But in reality, it is a defense initiative against the hostiles you saw today.

00:11:05.390 --> 00:11:07.520
All of this is of course classified information.

00:11:07.520 --> 00:11:09.560
Then when my dad died...

00:11:09.560 --> 00:11:12.020
It wasn't an accident, after all?

00:11:14.570 --> 00:11:16.480
Where did you get that gun?

00:11:18.360 --> 00:11:19.860
I don't know.

00:11:19.860 --> 00:11:22.410
I was just suddenly holding it.

00:11:22.910 --> 00:11:25.030
This toy won't be a problem.

00:11:25.620 --> 00:11:26.950
You can have it back.

00:11:35.750 --> 00:11:37.210
Those two...

00:11:37.210 --> 00:11:38.260
Those bastards!

00:11:40.840 --> 00:11:43.760
Who gave you permission to use the lead gears?!

00:11:44.930 --> 00:11:45.800
I knew it...

00:11:45.800 --> 00:11:48.180
Of course we're using them.

00:11:48.180 --> 00:11:51.890
If they were all as quiet and obedient as she is, they wouldn't be necessary.

00:11:52.270 --> 00:11:56.150
But a certain someone likes to invoke their singularity without warning.

00:11:56.150 --> 00:11:57.070
Teppei!

00:11:58.440 --> 00:11:59.530
You're Teppei, right?

00:12:00.740 --> 00:12:01.740
Daichi?

00:12:02.240 --> 00:12:03.450
Hey...

00:12:03.450 --> 00:12:05.280
Isn't she the girl

00:12:05.740 --> 00:12:07.870
we saw back then?

00:12:09.540 --> 00:12:14.170
Is he the boy who was there when Hana awoke?

00:12:14.170 --> 00:12:17.130
Did I not explicitly forbid the use of the lead gears?

00:12:17.130 --> 00:12:21.050
Salty Dog does not merely inspect Globe's operations.

00:12:19.590 --> 00:12:22.050
I've gotten even better at this.

00:12:21.050 --> 00:12:22.930
We also serve as its internal police force.

00:12:22.050 --> 00:12:22.930
Ah... Daichi!

00:12:22.930 --> 00:12:24.130
You've overstepped your authority!

00:12:24.130 --> 00:12:27.810
In emergency situations, I am authorized to take whatever measures I deem necessary.

00:12:24.590 --> 00:12:26.800
I'll keep the promise I made that day.

00:12:27.260 --> 00:12:27.810
Let's go!

00:12:28.220 --> 00:12:29.470
You too, Teppei!

00:12:29.010 --> 00:12:29.470
Daichi!

00:12:41.940 --> 00:12:42.490
Stop it!

00:12:47.950 --> 00:12:49.240
Are you okay?

00:12:49.870 --> 00:12:50.910
What are these things?

00:12:51.500 --> 00:12:53.000
What's going on?

00:12:53.970 --> 00:12:56.970
Eyecatch

00:13:00.630 --> 00:13:03.470
Don't let that animal out of its cage!

00:13:14.810 --> 00:13:16.650
I'm sorry about earlier...

00:13:17.350 --> 00:13:18.610
It hurt, didn't it?

00:13:19.520 --> 00:13:23.820
I'll make sure those people never touch you again.

00:13:29.830 --> 00:13:32.370
I don't think he fired the gun.

00:13:32.370 --> 00:13:34.540
I think the gun made him fire it.

00:13:35.620 --> 00:13:38.750
I believe Livlaster—the energy generator that it is—

00:13:39.330 --> 00:13:42.340
is more like an extra-dimensional life form

00:13:42.340 --> 00:13:46.510
that appears in the shape of a gun, but is not an actual gun.

00:13:46.510 --> 00:13:48.550
Indeed, it has a will of its own.

00:13:48.550 --> 00:13:51.760
And that will activated the Earth Engine.

00:13:52.310 --> 00:13:54.270
That would be the obvious conclusion.

00:13:54.850 --> 00:14:01.360
So what you're saying is that the Livlaster used him to activate the Earth Engine?

00:14:02.440 --> 00:14:04.690
Then, once the investigation ends,

00:14:04.690 --> 00:14:06.820
we have him swear an oath of secrecy

00:14:06.820 --> 00:14:08.610
and send him back to the mainland?

00:14:13.990 --> 00:14:19.040
Now that the Kill-T-Gang's active phase has begun, can we really get away with that?

00:14:22.630 --> 00:14:26.260
Technology and Research Division 3 is complaining that they can't set a schedule

00:14:26.760 --> 00:14:29.970
for the Machine Goodfellow demonstration experiments.

00:14:30.430 --> 00:14:32.430
Yeah, that's fine.

00:14:33.470 --> 00:14:39.140
Why are the Designer's Children being allowed to set the development schedule?

00:14:40.400 --> 00:14:42.150
That's just my policy.

00:14:42.730 --> 00:14:43.770
Is there something wrong with it?

00:14:45.860 --> 00:14:49.700
Couldn't it be dangerous to allow them too much freedom?

00:14:51.820 --> 00:14:53.080
What about the Ego Block?

00:14:53.080 --> 00:14:55.790
It's fine... It was unharmed.

00:14:55.790 --> 00:14:58.500
In Ego Block form,

00:14:58.500 --> 00:15:01.580
we can use the Entangle Link to travel through hyperspace.

00:15:02.040 --> 00:15:06.340
But if we materialize as an Ego Block too close to Earth,

00:15:06.340 --> 00:15:08.300
it causes a libido burst.

00:15:09.130 --> 00:15:10.800
The final approach must be

00:15:10.800 --> 00:15:14.600
through normal space via the Kill-T-Gang.

00:15:15.390 --> 00:15:18.020
If they knew how this worked

00:15:18.020 --> 00:15:22.230
when they designed their defense system, we'll need to be much more cautious.

00:15:22.230 --> 00:15:26.610
Life never goes the way you think it should, does it?

00:15:29.900 --> 00:15:34.990
So, what was the Impactor that shot down the Malkin like?

00:15:42.830 --> 00:15:46.460
A manned Impactor, using a Livlaster?

00:15:48.670 --> 00:15:51.430
Well, I'm told that letting them do what they want

00:15:51.930 --> 00:15:56.430
will be the quickest way to develop the Machine Goodfellows.

00:15:57.100 --> 00:15:58.310
You're told?

00:15:59.060 --> 00:16:01.100
By whom?

00:16:15.870 --> 00:16:19.540
Good evening, CEO Kube.

00:16:20.080 --> 00:16:22.830
Something seems to have happened
aboard the <i>Tenkaido</i>.

00:16:24.000 --> 00:16:26.840
I'm impressed you're aware of that.

00:16:26.840 --> 00:16:28.340
Very impressed.

00:16:29.130 --> 00:16:30.840
Stop talking like that.

00:16:31.840 --> 00:16:33.550
You don't like it?

00:16:33.550 --> 00:16:36.050
I think it's really cool and computer-y.

00:16:37.180 --> 00:16:41.230
Your secretary, little Hitomi, was wearing a very attractive suit today.

00:16:41.230 --> 00:16:43.350
You should ask her on a date.

00:16:43.350 --> 00:16:48.610
The Kill-T-Gang won't reach Earth sooner than anticipated, will they?

00:16:49.190 --> 00:16:52.070
My simulation's predictions are perfect.

00:16:52.070 --> 00:16:55.070
Globe will buy the required time.

00:16:55.660 --> 00:17:00.450
And if you'd gone for it, you could easily have had little Hitomi tonight.

00:17:00.450 --> 00:17:02.580
She was totally up for it.

00:17:03.160 --> 00:17:05.620
Humanity will survive.

00:17:05.620 --> 00:17:07.170
The chosen humanity...

00:17:07.710 --> 00:17:11.760
No, the humanity I choose.

00:17:11.760 --> 00:17:15.130
What is the Macbeth Revolution's present likelihood of success?

00:17:16.050 --> 00:17:17.890
One hundred percent.

00:17:17.890 --> 00:17:19.180
You're certain?

00:17:19.760 --> 00:17:21.770
Pac doesn't lie.

00:17:23.520 --> 00:17:26.020
I refuse to accept this method!

00:17:26.020 --> 00:17:27.440
He's still a kid!

00:17:27.810 --> 00:17:31.610
I can't have him behaving as he did yesterday.

00:17:32.280 --> 00:17:33.780
Science Chief, do it.

00:17:38.620 --> 00:17:40.080
Good morning, Daichi.

00:17:42.040 --> 00:17:43.830
I saw you yesterday...

00:17:46.420 --> 00:17:51.670
I'm this base's science chief, Peter Westvillage.

00:17:51.670 --> 00:17:54.880
Today, we'll be discussing the Livlaster,

00:17:54.880 --> 00:17:56.720
so I had these two accompany me.

00:17:57.260 --> 00:17:59.930
What's that girl's name?

00:18:00.470 --> 00:18:02.220
That is none of your business.

00:18:02.220 --> 00:18:06.350
There are many things in this world that you do not need to know.

00:18:07.730 --> 00:18:09.440
That's kind of exciting.

00:18:10.980 --> 00:18:14.280
The gun you had is the second of its kind.

00:18:14.780 --> 00:18:19.610
We believed the Livlaster you had to be a type of weapon.

00:18:20.280 --> 00:18:22.870
But its bearer, this girl...

00:18:22.870 --> 00:18:24.700
Mutou Hana cannot fire it.

00:18:25.620 --> 00:18:29.960
So we trained this boy, Arashi Teppei, to fire it instead.

00:18:30.670 --> 00:18:31.880
Mutou Hana...

00:18:32.750 --> 00:18:33.920
Your name's Hana!

00:18:34.550 --> 00:18:37.550
Science Chief, you're talking too much!

00:18:37.550 --> 00:18:38.380
It doesn't matter!

00:18:39.090 --> 00:18:43.140
He'll be working with us on this plan for a while.

00:18:43.140 --> 00:18:48.730
Where did you plan to take
these two yesterday?

00:18:51.560 --> 00:18:52.230
I just...

00:18:53.770 --> 00:18:55.230
Come out of there.

00:18:55.610 --> 00:18:57.490
I'll show you my boomerang.

00:19:00.740 --> 00:19:01.990
Boomerang?

00:19:03.780 --> 00:19:06.120
I just wanted to show them my boomerang.

00:19:06.540 --> 00:19:07.540
Your boomerang?

00:19:08.040 --> 00:19:09.410
Long ago, I promised her.

00:19:10.370 --> 00:19:11.830
Promised...

00:19:12.750 --> 00:19:14.500
Then he's just an idiot?

00:19:15.210 --> 00:19:18.550
Why were they suddenly in so much pain yesterday?

00:19:19.170 --> 00:19:21.300
They are under our protection and observation.

00:19:21.970 --> 00:19:26.180
As a necessary safety precaution, they wear lead gears on their heads.

00:19:26.640 --> 00:19:29.270
If they try to leave the base's quarantine zone,

00:19:29.270 --> 00:19:34.060
that sensor tower will detect it and inflict a minor degree of pain.

00:19:35.150 --> 00:19:37.190
Have they done something wrong?

00:19:38.240 --> 00:19:41.410
That isn't it. They're dangerous.

00:19:41.910 --> 00:19:44.450
They have a special power...

00:19:44.990 --> 00:19:49.200
And that means you'll be wearing one starting today, as well.

00:19:53.000 --> 00:19:55.130
I've sent a request to HQ for permission.

00:19:55.710 --> 00:20:00.510
We're going to investigate why you were able to fire the Livlaster.

00:20:01.510 --> 00:20:06.010
Just be grateful you survived firing even its first shot.

00:20:07.470 --> 00:20:10.140
It didn't feel like that kind of thing...

00:20:11.560 --> 00:20:14.400
Hey, where is my Livlaster?

00:20:14.400 --> 00:20:17.360
You seem to have the wrong idea.

00:20:17.360 --> 00:20:22.200
There is no such thing as "your" Livlaster.

00:20:22.200 --> 00:20:24.280
We're done here!

00:20:24.280 --> 00:20:25.620
Teppei... Hana.

00:20:28.240 --> 00:20:29.950
I'll wait at the coast.

00:20:32.370 --> 00:20:35.580
Manatsu Daichi is Manatsu Taiyo's son.

00:20:36.290 --> 00:20:40.800
His father came up with the name "Earth Engine."

00:20:42.380 --> 00:20:44.470
The power of a Captain...

00:20:45.140 --> 00:20:50.810
It's hard not to see the workings of fate in him boarding the Earth Engine.

00:20:54.190 --> 00:20:57.560
Isn't it kind of out of character for me to speak of fate like that?

00:20:58.770 --> 00:21:00.030
What's wrong?

00:21:00.030 --> 00:21:03.320
Manatsu Daichi's lead gear has gone into warning mode.

00:21:08.990 --> 00:21:10.620
This is rough...

00:21:17.920 --> 00:21:21.250
There's a strong Orgone signal from the Livlaster in storage!

00:21:21.250 --> 00:21:22.090
What's happening?

00:21:22.590 --> 00:21:23.800
We're losing it!

00:21:37.100 --> 00:21:37.900
What?

00:21:41.110 --> 00:21:41.610
Hana?

00:21:48.110 --> 00:21:48.870
Come here, Pitz.

00:21:56.580 --> 00:21:58.830
You think you're going outside, Hana?

00:21:59.130 --> 00:22:00.170
But...

00:22:04.710 --> 00:22:07.840
But I want to see the boomerang!

00:22:10.800 --> 00:22:12.760
The boomerang?

00:22:15.980 --> 00:22:16.730
Let's go!

00:22:23.980 --> 00:22:25.440
Got it...

00:22:26.570 --> 00:22:30.070
Hey, why did you come back to this island, Daichi?

00:22:31.070 --> 00:22:32.200
I told you.

00:22:32.200 --> 00:22:34.040
I came to fulfill my promise.

00:22:35.290 --> 00:22:37.710
Also, I remembered...

00:22:38.580 --> 00:22:42.000
How good the wind on this island feels...

00:24:13.760 --> 00:24:15.100
I'll be living with Uncle Nishikubo...

00:24:15.100 --> 00:24:17.060
I mean, the commander.

00:24:17.060 --> 00:24:21.810
It'll be Teppei and me, and Hana and Akari.

00:24:22.440 --> 00:24:25.730
But the Kill-T-Gang attacks again!

00:24:25.730 --> 00:24:28.400
And because of Salty Dog's plot,

00:24:28.400 --> 00:24:31.570
I launch in a malfunctioning Earth Engine.

